{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_0_level_main_00-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": "main_00-07",
  "title": "Infection",
  "storyCode": "0-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8b17070e45a9f42038b8a93d655511fec07205023487deb0981c00ed73e29103",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Based on our planned route, we should be approaching the central town of South Chernobog."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "We'll arrive at the rendezvous point after crossing this park. Assuming no contingencies, Nearl and Team E4 should be waiting for us there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "If Nearl was attacked... What would we do then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "What if they wanted to alert us, but couldn't due to communications being jammed..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "How should we deal with that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We will go assess the situation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "...Oh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Don't start speculating before seeing things with your own eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "There's no point of letting paranoia get the better of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "I, I see..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Losing our communications has caused anxiety to spread through the ranks much faster than I imagined..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Especially with this looming Catastrophe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "We have to pick up our pace."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Ugh... What's with this haze...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Could it be--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Watch out! !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Kill them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Incoming enemy fire! !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "It's a trap...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "--! !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "This is bad! Reunion forces have showed up behind us...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Where's our scout?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "They got separated from us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "I've caught you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Kill them all! !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "This time, I'll grind your bones to dust!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Dobermann!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Snipers, stop their advance!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Defenders, hold the line. Get ready to push forward!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Ace, prepare to--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Time out, time out--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "? !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "I only just finished purging the Southeast Fortress, but I rushed over here as soon as I heard the news."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "These are my hunting grounds, Crownslayer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Crownslayer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "What'd you come here for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "Isn't it about time you handed them over to me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
